{"content":[{"c":["EDUTH*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Hebrew word usually translated “testimony,” “witness,” or “commandment.” It is used with reference to the tabernacle (",{"href":"?bref=Num.17.7-8","r":"Num.17.7-8","rawR":"Num.17.7-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.17.7-8","value":"Num.17.7-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 17:7-8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.18.2","r":"Num.18.2","rawR":"Num.18.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.18.2","value":"Num.18.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"18:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.24.6","r":"2Chr.24.6","rawR":"2Chr.24.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.24.6","value":"2Chr.24.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 24:6"},"), the ark (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.25.16","r":"Exod.25.16","rawR":"Exod.25.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.25.16","value":"Exod.25.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 25:16"},"), the Ten Commandments (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.31.18","r":"Exod.31.18","rawR":"Exod.31.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.31.18","value":"Exod.31.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 31:18"},"), and the law of God in general (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.19.8","r":"Ps.19.8","rawR":"Ps.19.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.19.8","value":"Ps.19.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 19:8"},"). The transliterated form appears only in the title of ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.60.1-12","r":"Ps.60.1-12","rawR":"Ps.60.1-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.60.1-12","value":"Ps.60.1-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 60"}," in the Hebrew phrase ",{"c":["Shushan Eduth."],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," The phrase means “Lily of Testimony.”"],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Music"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Eduth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 17:7-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to